Tool Dost - Data Privacy & Deletion Policy
Tool Dost app users ke data ki privacy ka poora dhyan rakhta hai. Hum aapka koi bhi personal data ya account information kisi server par store NAHI karte hain. Aapka saara data aapke device (phone) mein hi locally save hota hai.

Data Kaise Delete Karein:
Agar aap app ko uninstall kar dete hain, toh aapka saara local data aapke phone se permanently delete ho jata hai.

App ke andar option:
Aap bina uninstall kiye bhi app ke Profile > Delete Account section mein ja kar apna data turant saaf (clear) kar sakte hain.

Agar aapka koi aur sawal hai, toh aap hame yahan sampark kar sakte hain: aapka-email@gmail.com.
